OL,3,GNEWSAOfficial's working from Caribbean
OL,4,Acriticised
OL,5,
OL,6,FA politician has criticised the
OL,7,Foversight of a working arrangement
OL,8,Fwhich saw a senior civil servant
OL,9,Foperating from the British Virgin
OL,10,FIslands (BVI) in the Caribbean.
OL,12,FDeputy Rob Curgenven said the fact the
OL,13,FStates of Guernsey's former Director of
OL,14,FPopulation Managament Gary Salter was
OL,15,Fworking from the BVI showed the
OL,16,F"dysfunctional" way the civil service
OL,17,Fwas managed.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
