OL,3,GNEWSAOfficial's working from Caribbean
OL,4,Acriticised
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn responses to questions from
OL,7,FCurgenven, the Committee for Home
OL,8,FAffairs (HA) also revealed the
OL,9,Fcommittee only found out Salter was
OL,10,Fworking away from Guernsey when the BBC
OL,11,Fbroke the news on 18 August.
OL,13,FEarlier this month, top civil servant
OL,14,FBoley Smillie announced the former
OL,15,Fdirector of population management had
OL,16,Fleft the role.
